{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgksYXcgm3osAh8cwyuxF","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Bottom line: keep it. A keren hishtalmut is a savings pot where my boss and I both put in part of my salary each month. After 6 years I can take it all out tax-free, or after 3 if it's for studying. I can take it out earlier, but then I pay tax and the page says that's \"יקרה\". I'm fairly sure, but not totally.\n\nWhat decided it was one line near the top: \"עד 7.5% מהשכר מהמעסיק ועד 2.5% מכם\". My boss puts in three times what I do. That's free money, so I'm not dropping it.\n\nThe thing that threw me was their example with the two bars. After 10 years the keren comes out at 17,370 ₪ and a \"חשבון ניירות ערך\" at 16,955 ₪, so it's only \"₪415.84 יותר\". That's nothing. Then a few lines down there's a range from \"−342.02 ₪\" to \"2,106 ₪\" and the minus made me nervous. I think the boss's money isn't in that comparison, but it was buried in a long paragraph and I'm not sure I read it right.\n\n**What I looked at, in order:**\n1. **Top of the page:** the heading \"קרן השתלמות\" and the line under it. That's exactly what I came for, so I stayed.\n2. **\"מה זה\":** I read most of it. 6 years tax-free, 3 for studies, you can take money out earlier but it's taxed, and the 7.5% / 2.5% split.\n3. **\"למה משתמשים בזה\":** first line only, \"הפקדת המעסיק מגיעה רק לכאן\".\n4. **The calculator box:** it showed salary 12,000 ₪, \"שכיר\", and an example of 10,000 ₪ now plus 500 ₪ a month. I didn't touch it; there's no 10,000 in my keren.\n5. **The two bars:** I looked at the big numbers and the 415 difference. The table under them (\"עלויות\", \"מס\") I just glanced at.\n6. **The long paragraphs after that:** skimmed. I caught \"₪300 נחשבים הפקדה מוטבת\" and \"₪900\".\n7. **\"שווה לדעת\" list:** saw the first line, \"6 שנים\" again.\n8. **\"כסף נכנס ויוצא\":** the big cards. \"כשעוברות 6 שנים\", money arrives within \"עד 4 ימי עסקים\", and you can switch tracks \"בלי מס\".\n9. **\"כמה זה עולה\":** \"עד 2% בשנה\". A percent, sounds small.\n10. **Orange box:** first line only, \"משיכה לפני הזמן אפשרית, אבל יקרה\". Enough to know not to touch it before 6 years.\n\n**What I skipped:**\n- \"מי מציע ומי מפקח\" and the company cards\n- \"מיסוי\", apart from the headings\n- \"סיכונים ומה לא מוגן\"\n- The whole glossary table at the bottom, the footer and all the small grey text\n- Every \"חוקים וכללים\" button and the \"שחקו עם המספרים שלכם\" fold\n\n**Words I didn't get:** \"הפקדה מוטבת\", \"הרווח הריאלי\", \"ותק\", \"משכורת קובעת\", \"נאמנות\", \"קופת גמל להשקעה\", \"חשבון ניירות ערך\" (sort of), \"מסלול כללי\", and \"אג\"ח ממשלתית צמודה / לא צמודה\".\n\n**Where I got lost or bored:**\n- The paragraphs under the bars, with 300, 200, 900 and 15,712. I lost track of what's mine and what's my boss's.\n- From \"מיסוי\" on it's just walls of text. On the bus, that's where I'd close it.\n- The page never tells me what to actually do. Do I check which company runs mine, or change my track? There's nothing like that."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":8332,"cache_read_input_tokens":11521,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":8332},"output_tokens":6,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"4ffc5086-68ac-443e-93f2-d8b51234a49c","uuid":"10b72812-7646-428c-8946-f5e5000deb85","timestamp":"2026-11-06T02:18:33.602Z","request_id":"req_011CgksYXPof7frHkfEdrveY"}
